Carbon Design System icons
==========================
These SVG files (32px variants) come from the npm package @carbon/icons
version 11.89.0 (https://github.com/carbon-design-system/carbon,
https://www.carbondesignsystem.com/building-blocks/foundations/icons/library),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

Copyright IBM Corp. and the Carbon Design System contributors.

The files are vendored unmodified. They are inlined at render time by
aeo_audit/platform/icons.py (the only place that reads them); nothing is loaded
from a CDN at runtime. To add an icon, copy it from
`@carbon/icons/svg/32/<name>.svg` (npm pack @carbon/icons) into this folder.
